# Omniscience says "you": only its controller casts spells without paying their mana costs, and only at the times the spell
# could be cast anyway (CR 601.3, 307.1). Bot1 puts it onto the battlefield on turn 1. On Bot2's turn 2, Bot2's Lightning
# Bolt is not offered without paying its mana cost, though Bot2 casts it for {R} at Bot1. In that turn Bot1 may not cast
# Embereth Shieldbreaker (a creature, at sorcery speed) or its Adventure Battle Display (a sorcery) at all, but casts its
# own Lightning Bolt, an instant, for nothing at Bot2.

